        "tree_id": "62e3975c6c41941f2b05122b28fe2ac849fc6988",
        "message": "feat(HC-003): two-client T2 replay and measured CIS v1\n\nOne act, 900 ticks, 3 facts across 3 strata with physical variant swaps,\n6 before/after captures. Two independent clients agree on fact ids, variant\nids, epoch and state hash. CIS = 85/100 computed from the demo into\ndocs/state/metrics/concept.json: demo 30, propagation 20, variants 15,\nwow 0, traceability 10, signed novelty 10.\n\nWow density is 0 because no playtest exists — I13 forbids inventing the\nnumber; the reason is stored in the evidence source.\n\nReal defect fixed: concept.json in the metrics folder was selected as the\nlatest session metrics and broke the dashboard truth check; the builder now\nfilters YYYY-MM-DD-sN.json only.\n\nGDD-CONSEQUENCE 0.5; vitest includes tests/replay/*.spec.ts so the blueprint\nacc actually runs. Replay 3/3, --score 0, full 188/188, verify 19/19.\n\nAgent: high-concept-guardian\nTask: HC-003",
